379
00:05:27,097 --> 00:05:31,767
We had to surrender information to them about
 infected autoreivs which are under <i>our</i> jurisdiction.

380
00:05:32,687 --> 00:05:35,317
But, they don't intend to tell the Intelligence Bureau anything.

381
00:05:35,817 --> 00:05:38,317
Who was that new guy - Raul?

382
00:05:38,317 --> 00:05:39,067
I don't like him at all.

383
00:05:39,487 --> 00:05:40,577
This guy, huh.

384
00:05:41,577 --> 00:05:42,657
Oh,

385
00:05:42,657 --> 00:05:45,657
and the tacked-on report of the brutal homicide of a civilian...

386
00:05:46,207 --> 00:05:51,207
It couldn't possibly be by a
 cogito-infected autoreiv that went out of control.

387
00:05:52,797 --> 00:05:53,587
Re-l...

388
00:05:53,587 --> 00:05:55,007
That's enough!

389
00:05:55,007 --> 00:05:57,507
Cut Turing function app from speech area.

390
00:05:58,257 --> 00:05:59,297
Understood.

391
00:05:59,297 --> 00:06:00,637
App has been disabled.

392
00:06:00,637 --> 00:06:02,307
Please confirm.

393
00:06:02,967 --> 00:06:06,847
Then take the shortest route to the Autoreiv Control Facility

394
00:06:06,847 --> 00:06:07,887
in interim immigrant sectors F and G.

395
00:06:08,477 --> 00:06:09,557
Confirmed.

396
00:06:23,237 --> 00:06:24,577
<i>Romdeau City...</i>

397
00:06:25,907 --> 00:06:27,617
<i>There is no doubt</i>

398
00:06:27,617 --> 00:06:30,077
<i>that it is our last paradise.</i>

399
00:06:32,787 --> 00:06:35,957
<i>Within this cradle, which was built</i>

400
00:06:35,957 --> 00:06:37,877
<i>as the planetary environment deteriorated...</i>

401
00:06:39,257 --> 00:06:42,007
<i>life continues today as it always has.</i>

402
00:06:45,387 --> 00:06:47,137
<i>A paradise of boredom...</i>

403
00:07:13,537 --> 00:07:14,587
Then...

404
00:07:14,587 --> 00:07:18,257
you were able to confirm that the
 PK-30 type that got away was infected?

405
00:07:19,167 --> 00:07:20,087
I'm sorry,

406
00:07:20,087 --> 00:07:21,127
Dorothy.

407
00:07:22,007 --> 00:07:24,547
I'll submit a report of the escaped target.

408
00:07:24,967 --> 00:07:26,137
However...

409
00:07:30,727 --> 00:07:32,477
However, Intelligence Bureau staff

410
00:07:32,477 --> 00:07:34,767
will be here today regarding that,

411
00:07:34,767 --> 00:07:36,607
so be sure to meet with them.

412
00:07:37,227 --> 00:07:38,437
Yes...

413
00:07:38,437 --> 00:07:39,647
Next,

414
00:07:39,647 --> 00:07:41,277
your new infection investigation.

415
00:07:41,947 --> 00:07:45,317
You have been issued documents
 authorizing your access to the citizen residential sector.

416
00:07:48,157 --> 00:07:49,497
Don't worry.

417
00:07:50,367 --> 00:07:52,747
If you do as I say,

418
00:07:52,747 --> 00:07:54,457
you'll be able to become a model citizen.

419
00:07:55,167 --> 00:07:57,627
Don't suck up to an Entourage.

420
00:07:58,087 --> 00:08:00,717
Entourages are just autoreivs.

421
00:08:00,717 --> 00:08:02,377
You must try harder to interact with people

422
00:08:02,377 --> 00:08:04,967
in order to become a model citizen.

423
00:08:05,507 --> 00:08:07,757
Inspector... Re-l.

424
00:08:08,387 --> 00:08:09,847
We last saw each other at the interview, didn't we?

425
00:08:12,137 --> 00:08:14,147
He is Vincent Law.

426
00:08:14,147 --> 00:08:15,517
Vincent.

427
00:08:15,517 --> 00:08:16,897
Miss!

428
00:08:17,817 --> 00:08:20,607
If you'd only told me, I would've welcomed you-

429
00:08:19,607 --> 00:08:22,567
She's been telling you to stop calling her that for a long time.

430
00:08:29,697 --> 00:08:30,657
Um,

431
00:08:30,657 --> 00:08:33,497
this is the infected autoreiv from last night.

432
00:08:35,167 --> 00:08:36,247
Horrible.

433
00:08:36,917 --> 00:08:39,497
With the equipment available to control unit personnel,

434
00:08:39,497 --> 00:08:43,127
we can't disable them without going this far.

435
00:08:44,427 --> 00:08:45,337
Is that sarcasm?

436
00:08:46,257 --> 00:08:47,217
No,

437
00:08:47,217 --> 00:08:48,507
I'm sorry.

438
00:08:49,137 --> 00:08:50,717
This is the file.

439
00:08:52,427 --> 00:08:56,767
Infection among this type has recently increased.

440
00:08:58,897 --> 00:09:00,187
Analyzing.

441
00:09:00,977 --> 00:09:04,277
Autoreivs infected by a virus called cogito

442
00:09:04,277 --> 00:09:07,407
are said to break free of human control and acquire an ego.

443
00:09:10,077 --> 00:09:14,037
Romdeau is a city with a system
 deeming survival to be everything.

444
00:09:15,287 --> 00:09:18,417
Even the prayers supposedly offered
 by autoreivs that are prepared to die

445
00:09:18,417 --> 00:09:19,917
are unnecessary factors.

446
00:09:20,877 --> 00:09:24,087
Your job is to protect the citizens from these factors.

447
00:09:24,837 --> 00:09:26,757
That is also the shortest path for an immigrant

448
00:09:26,757 --> 00:09:28,217
to become a model citizen.

449
00:09:29,757 --> 00:09:31,387
By the way, Vincent.

450
00:09:31,387 --> 00:09:32,767
Y-Yes?

451
00:09:32,767 --> 00:09:34,637
You're still holding onto <i>that</i>?

452
00:09:36,437 --> 00:09:37,437
Y-Yes...

453
00:09:37,437 --> 00:09:40,107
Toss anything that carries the Mosk's scent.

454
00:09:42,607 --> 00:09:43,977
In the preliminary inquiry-

455
00:09:43,977 --> 00:09:45,397
Analysis complete.

456
00:09:45,947 --> 00:09:46,897
And?

457
00:09:49,157 --> 00:09:50,987
You're in luck, Re-l.

458
00:09:50,987 --> 00:09:54,617
Part of the autonomic neural file escaped infection.

459
00:09:55,197 --> 00:09:57,407
I reconstituted it from mnemonic data

460
00:09:57,407 --> 00:09:59,667
and got the potential escape radius.

461
00:09:59,667 --> 00:10:00,457
Good.

462
00:10:00,457 --> 00:10:01,087
Um...

463
00:10:01,087 --> 00:10:03,297
Return to your duties.

464
00:10:03,297 --> 00:10:05,377
The Entourage is waiting for you.

465
00:10:12,427 --> 00:10:15,177
He kept staring at you, Re-l.

466
00:10:15,467 --> 00:10:16,427
I wonder.

467
00:10:16,427 --> 00:10:18,017
You'd noticed.

468
00:10:18,887 --> 00:10:20,187
Vincent.

469
00:10:22,017 --> 00:10:23,397
Sorry to ask this of you after an all-nighter,

470
00:10:23,397 --> 00:10:25,527
but let's get you working on redeeming yourself.

471
00:10:25,527 --> 00:10:27,817
It's a request to investigate a possibly infected autoreiv.

472
00:10:27,817 --> 00:10:31,487
His face is that of a model citizen,

473
00:10:28,527 --> 00:10:29,777
It's urgent.

474
00:10:31,487 --> 00:10:33,867
the face of a person this city wants.

475
00:10:36,157 --> 00:10:37,617
A boring face.

476
00:10:39,917 --> 00:10:42,917
But perhaps I myself am an unnecessary factor

477
00:10:43,537 --> 00:10:45,337
for looking down on them.

478
00:10:48,627 --> 00:10:49,967
Let's go, Iggy.

479
00:11:00,057 --> 00:11:02,097
I don't know when.

480
00:11:03,727 --> 00:11:04,937
I'll leave that to you.

481
00:11:05,517 --> 00:11:06,527
Sorry about that.

482
00:11:08,437 --> 00:11:09,567
Please continue.

483
00:11:09,567 --> 00:11:10,697
Yes.

484
00:11:10,697 --> 00:11:12,317
We have expanded our search radius

485
00:11:12,317 --> 00:11:16,367
to include interim immigrant sectors D, E, and F.

486
00:11:16,827 --> 00:11:19,617
Armed autoreivs are patrolling the area

487
00:11:19,617 --> 00:11:22,167
with the Mainland and the Island as their main focus,

488
00:11:22,167 --> 00:11:23,997
but they have been unable to find the specimen.

489
00:11:25,287 --> 00:11:29,377
So it is possible that it is no longer in the residential sectors.

490
00:11:29,377 --> 00:11:30,967
I will see to the arrangements at once.

491
00:11:32,217 --> 00:11:35,007
An abandoned Immigration Bureau facility, eh?

492
00:11:35,677 --> 00:11:38,927
Several immigrants are apparently occupying it illegally.

493
00:11:40,017 --> 00:11:40,677
HQ.

494
00:11:41,727 --> 00:11:43,977
We have reached the projected escape radius.

495
00:11:43,977 --> 00:11:45,017
Yes.

496
00:11:45,017 --> 00:11:46,687
The rest will be arranged by the Bureau Chief.

497
00:11:47,147 --> 00:11:49,147
The details will be reported later.

498
00:11:51,817 --> 00:11:55,197
Re-l, we have orders to wait for the Security Bureau to arrive.

499
00:11:55,197 --> 00:11:56,157
From the Bureau Chief-

500
00:12:13,297 --> 00:12:14,177
That is...

501
00:12:14,177 --> 00:12:15,427
my Mary.

502
00:12:19,057 --> 00:12:20,347
I got her ID.

503
00:12:20,347 --> 00:12:22,727
ED-26731.

504
00:12:22,727 --> 00:12:24,477
It's a companion-type autoreiv.

505
00:12:24,477 --> 00:12:25,397
Damn.

506
00:12:26,857 --> 00:12:29,647
Show your immigrant ID, please.

507
00:13:03,427 --> 00:13:05,187
Wh-What?

508
00:13:23,117 --> 00:13:24,867
It's infected by cogito...

509
00:13:39,967 --> 00:13:41,347
Re-l, what happened?

510
00:13:42,467 --> 00:13:44,807
Confirmed elimination of one target.

511
00:13:46,977 --> 00:13:48,057
Wait!

512
00:13:49,647 --> 00:13:50,647
Iggy,

513
00:13:50,647 --> 00:13:52,017
the autoreiv-

514
00:13:58,907 --> 00:14:00,447
What's going on?

515
00:14:00,447 --> 00:14:01,407
Iggy.

516
00:14:01,407 --> 00:14:02,697
Contact the Control Division.

517
00:14:02,697 --> 00:14:04,577
Have them pursue it.

518
00:14:04,997 --> 00:14:05,697
Roger.

519
00:14:06,207 --> 00:14:07,367
More importantly...

520
00:14:23,467 --> 00:14:24,637
What was...

521
00:14:24,637 --> 00:14:25,597
that?

522
00:14:49,117 --> 00:14:51,627
The analysis is now complete, but...

523
00:14:51,627 --> 00:14:54,547
it seems there are no symptoms indicating infection.

524
00:14:54,547 --> 00:14:56,127
That's impossible.

525
00:14:56,417 --> 00:14:58,007
Even yesterday, Pino-

526
00:14:58,007 --> 00:14:58,757
However...

527
00:14:58,757 --> 00:15:00,087
the test results

528
00:15:00,087 --> 00:15:01,587
are conclusive.

529
00:15:04,677 --> 00:15:06,177
Oh, yes.

530
00:15:06,177 --> 00:15:07,137
To tell you the truth,

531
00:15:07,467 --> 00:15:10,097
the Health and Welfare Human
 Resources Division just made a decision

532
00:15:10,097 --> 00:15:13,147
to finally grant me a child like I've been wanting all these years.

533
00:15:13,647 --> 00:15:15,517
In that case, I feel it'd be better

534
00:15:15,517 --> 00:15:17,607
to have an autoreiv that can double as a housekeeper-type

535
00:15:17,607 --> 00:15:20,567
for educating and raising the child...

536
00:15:20,567 --> 00:15:21,657
It is certainly true

537
00:15:21,657 --> 00:15:24,317
that consumption is what model citizens should do.

538
00:15:24,317 --> 00:15:25,367
However,

539
00:15:25,367 --> 00:15:26,987
insofar as she is not infected,

540
00:15:26,987 --> 00:15:29,157
I cannot collect her because of the regulations-

541
00:15:29,157 --> 00:15:30,117
You...

542
00:15:30,117 --> 00:15:31,667
are just an immigrant.

543
00:15:34,997 --> 00:15:37,917
You won't do as I say, even though you're an immigrant?

544
00:15:40,417 --> 00:15:42,047
Even though you're an immigrant...

545
00:15:42,797 --> 00:15:45,177
I am the Citizen Security Bureau's-

546
00:15:48,177 --> 00:15:51,347
You must not say bad things about immigrants,

547
00:15:51,347 --> 00:15:52,687
Mother.

548
00:15:54,727 --> 00:15:55,897
Mother,

549
00:15:55,897 --> 00:15:58,777
you haven't cleaned yet today.

550
00:15:58,777 --> 00:16:01,197
When Father comes back...

551
00:16:03,107 --> 00:16:04,317
Raul.

552
00:16:04,817 --> 00:16:08,197
To have this situation arise so soon
 after your inauguration as the Bureau Chief

553
00:16:08,197 --> 00:16:09,907
is bad luck.

554
00:16:09,907 --> 00:16:11,207
On the other hand,

555
00:16:11,207 --> 00:16:13,577
you may actually be a lucky man after all,

556
00:16:13,577 --> 00:16:16,787
now that PROXY has awakened.

557
00:16:17,247 --> 00:16:18,627
A door-to-door search operation

558
00:16:18,627 --> 00:16:20,667
has been in action throughout Romdeau City

559
00:16:20,667 --> 00:16:25,007
since last night, with a primary
 focus on citizen residential sectors.

560
00:16:25,007 --> 00:16:26,927
However, it has yet to be found.

561
00:16:27,717 --> 00:16:29,177
That would mean

562
00:16:29,177 --> 00:16:33,557
it has already escaped into the
 immigrant sectors beyond the city's outer limits?

563
00:16:34,557 --> 00:16:36,897
That would seem to be the reasonable conclusion.

564
00:16:36,897 --> 00:16:39,187
Immigrants without a master...

565
00:16:39,817 --> 00:16:42,607
One of them may have abetted its escape.

566
00:16:42,607 --> 00:16:44,817
That is out of the question.

567
00:16:44,817 --> 00:16:48,447
They do not even know of its existence.

568
00:16:48,447 --> 00:16:50,287
We would like to confirm one thing.

569
00:16:50,287 --> 00:16:51,867
What would that be?

570
00:16:51,867 --> 00:16:54,157
Are we limited to capture only?

571
00:16:54,787 --> 00:16:58,877
At this point, forty-one civilian deaths have been confirmed.

572
00:16:59,287 --> 00:17:01,087
In recent years, we have had many incidents in our city

573
00:17:01,087 --> 00:17:03,877
involving autoreivs infected by the cogito virus

574
00:17:03,877 --> 00:17:06,467
going inexplicably berserk.

575
00:17:06,467 --> 00:17:09,557
The number of victims has also
 continued to increase correspondingly.

576
00:17:10,097 --> 00:17:12,557
Even citizens, who are under strict information control,

577
00:17:12,557 --> 00:17:14,807
will become anxious over time.

578
00:17:17,307 --> 00:17:19,397
As a means of maintaining stability in the city government,

579
00:17:19,397 --> 00:17:22,067
we would like permission to
 eliminate it in the event of an emergency.

580
00:17:29,777 --> 00:17:30,737
Raul,

581
00:17:30,737 --> 00:17:32,407
don't get ahead of yourself.

582
00:17:32,407 --> 00:17:34,287
Capture it without fail.

583
00:17:34,287 --> 00:17:36,617
You must not kill it at any cost.

584
00:17:37,327 --> 00:17:41,297
Civilian casualties are acceptable to a certain extent.

585
00:17:41,587 --> 00:17:42,957
If their numbers start falling short,

586
00:17:42,957 --> 00:17:45,087
we merely need to produce more.

587
00:17:45,467 --> 00:17:47,677
In any case, capture it and bring it back.

588
00:17:48,087 --> 00:17:49,547
Is that clear,

589
00:17:49,547 --> 00:17:50,677
Raul?

590
00:17:52,347 --> 00:17:54,137
One last thing:

591
00:17:54,977 --> 00:17:57,937
What <i>is</i> "PROXY"?

592
00:18:02,687 --> 00:18:03,527
Re-l,

593
00:18:03,527 --> 00:18:06,107
I've already found four bodies thus far.

594
00:18:06,697 --> 00:18:09,907
This must be what the Security Bureau wants to hide.

595
00:18:10,697 --> 00:18:13,117
There is one more thing I found out.

596
00:18:15,697 --> 00:18:18,707
The killer wasn't a cogito-infected autoreiv.

597
00:18:19,667 --> 00:18:20,957
Then who?

598
00:18:34,137 --> 00:18:37,347
The Security Bureau has transmitted an order.

599
00:18:37,347 --> 00:18:39,307
Continuing your current actions

600
00:18:39,307 --> 00:18:42,437
may violate your job regulations.

601
00:18:46,937 --> 00:18:48,277
Fine, fine.

602
00:18:49,107 --> 00:18:51,777
Still, though I was told to secure the crime scene,

603
00:18:51,777 --> 00:18:53,947
I was not forbidden from taking a look.

604
00:18:54,737 --> 00:18:56,447
Well, sure, but...

605
00:18:58,077 --> 00:18:58,957
C'mon.

606
00:18:58,957 --> 00:19:01,167
Let's go home before that yucky guy comes.

607
00:19:01,707 --> 00:19:05,417
Anyway, seems like I'll get scolded
 by Grandfather again if I go any further.

608
00:19:06,457 --> 00:19:07,917
Huh?

609
00:19:07,917 --> 00:19:09,007
Re-l.

610
00:19:09,587 --> 00:19:10,927
Hey, what are you talking about?

611
00:19:11,467 --> 00:19:13,097
No need for you to know, Iggy.

612
00:19:17,467 --> 00:19:19,057
I'm very sorry,

613
00:19:19,057 --> 00:19:21,557
but please submit documents to the Specialty Bureau-

614
00:19:30,357 --> 00:19:31,607
Dorothy...

615
00:19:45,207 --> 00:19:46,957
This destructive capability

616
00:19:46,957 --> 00:19:49,627
and jumping ability demonstrated during its escape...

617
00:19:50,507 --> 00:19:53,717
Neither are possible, even by high-performance autoreivs.

618
00:19:54,137 --> 00:19:55,177
Isn't that right?

619
00:19:55,507 --> 00:19:58,517
What could've been the purpose behind conducting research

620
00:19:58,517 --> 00:20:00,387
on such a monster in utter secrecy?

621
00:20:01,177 --> 00:20:03,397
The representative would not say, but...

622
00:20:07,727 --> 00:20:09,397
To be quite frank,

623
00:20:09,397 --> 00:20:11,277
I do not know either.

624
00:20:11,947 --> 00:20:15,527
I was merely babysitting the
 comatose specimen as it slept on endlessly.

625
00:20:16,487 --> 00:20:17,487
However,

626
00:20:17,487 --> 00:20:21,157
obtaining its abilities will have great significance...

627
00:20:24,497 --> 00:20:26,837
That's what I'm beginning to think, in any case.

628
00:20:28,457 --> 00:20:29,797
Chief Raul.

629
00:20:30,507 --> 00:20:32,007
From the team in interim immigrant sector D.

630
00:20:35,467 --> 00:20:36,677
Re-l Mayer?

631
00:20:42,727 --> 00:20:44,267
Like I said, Iggy,

632
00:20:44,267 --> 00:20:46,437
access HQ's databank

633
00:20:46,437 --> 00:20:48,857
and put together a dossier of similar incidents.

634
00:20:49,397 --> 00:20:50,397
Roger.

635
00:21:19,717 --> 00:21:21,847
Grandfather's summons...

636
00:21:23,227 --> 00:21:25,597
The Security Bureau's suspicious actions...

637
00:21:27,227 --> 00:21:29,267
And... <i>that...</i>

638
00:21:36,237 --> 00:21:39,827
These dots will connect somewhere; I'm sure of it.

639
00:21:43,827 --> 00:21:45,957
And that was my day.

640
00:21:54,627 --> 00:21:55,507
Hm?

